  "releaseNotes": "* Update DotPrimitives version from 4.1.0 to 4.2.0\n* Added ``OperatingSystem`` ``IsUnix`` extension\n* Added PlatformNotSupportedException throw method overloads with params arrays arguments\n* Code formatting improvements\n* Potential performance improvements for some string insertion and replacement methods.\n* Simplified Directory ``IsEmpty`` static Property extension code\n* Clarified that two internal .NET Standard 2.0 fallback methods should only be called directly by Unit Testing and Benchmarking - DotExtensions and external callers should use the non-TFM specific method instead.\n* Added some missing xml doc comments\n* Fixed grammar issues in a few xml doc comments",
